  "ufotable": "The studio developed integrated digital production methods that combine drawn characters, effects and three-dimensional environments for elaborate action staging.",
  "mappa": "The studio has produced projects with varied visual identities, with this atlas look grouping selected tendencies in detailed character rendering and forceful action photography.",
  "yuasa": "Yuasa's animation experiments with elastic drawing and changing graphic rules, treating distortion and rhythm as expressive storytelling tools.",
